# HubEnts workflow skills (Cursor)

When the user asks to **deploy**, **release**, **ship to production**, **run pre-deploy checks**, **push to main**, or **Vercel**: follow the project skill **`hubents-deploy`** (`.cursor/skills/hubents-deploy/SKILL.md`).

When they need **database migrations**, **Drizzle/Neon schema changes**, **new migration SQL**: follow **`hubents-database-migration`**.

When they change **`/api/v1`**, **OpenAPI**, **MCP tools**, **webhook event types**, **API scopes**, or **developers changelog**: follow **`hubents-api-changelog-update`** before release.

## Suggested order for complex releases

1. Schema changes → **`hubents-database-migration`** first
2. Public API surface changes → **`hubents-api-changelog-update`**
3. Production release → **`hubents-deploy`**

